# um-texts 1
=== QUESTITEM AmbushKey00
Traps key
A figurine which can switch off magic traps (use it on magic obelisks).

=== QUESTITEM Ancientsword
Rusty sword
Babur cannot work with metals, so he's unable either to repair it or charge with a spell.

=== QUESTITEM Awl
Bodkin
A steel bodkin is one of the tools stolen from Master Babur.

=== QUESTITEM BillBoard00
Notice board
A notice board in Ingos.

=== QUESTITEM BrokenGear00
Gear to the bridge over the ravine
A part of the drawbridge across the dry ravine. You have to cross it to get to Shei-Var.

=== QUESTITEM BrokenToy
Fractions of teleport amulet
These shreds would tell a skilful magician where the teleport has been directed.

=== QUESTITEM CageKey00
Cage key
Use this to open a cage.

=== QUESTITEM CaveGear00
Cave bridge mechanism
A part of the Cave Orcs' drawbridge. This will lower the bridge in the cave.

=== QUESTITEM CaveKey00
Key to the cave passage
This key can be used to open the passage in the deepest part of the cave.

=== QUESTITEM CodedHadaganNote
Note from abandoned camp
A note written in strange language. Chief Erfar may know it.

=== QUESTITEM CryptKey00
Sarcophagus key
The key to the sarcophagus where the Orc leader keeps his treasure.

=== QUESTITEM CryptRune00
Magic bit
Magic bit which might be of interest to Estera the Witch.

=== QUESTITEM DCBook
Book from observatory
This contains information which will open the way to Dead City.

=== QUESTITEM DeadScientist00
Scientist's head
The remnants of the scientist whose spirit can tell you all about the young Joon  man.

=== QUESTITEM DocumentBook
Manager's records
Documents which prove that merchant Karansul does take part in illegal schemes.

=== QUESTITEM DragonAmulet
Dragon amulet
This can suppress a Dragon's will, but it can only be used on one Dragon at a time.

=== QUESTITEM DragonPoison
Poison
Poison issued by the Dragon for the mission.

=== QUESTITEM DragonShell00
Big shell
The Lizards' idol, a symbol of peace. Lizards behave less aggressively near a shell.

=== QUESTITEM DragonWand
[Must be, but needs no translation]
[Must be, but need no translation]

=== QUESTITEM DriadArrow00
Arrow
The snoop who was looking for the Princess was killed by this arrow.

=== QUESTITEM DriadCageKey00
Woodsfolk cage key
Use this to open the cage.

=== QUESTITEM DriadIdol00
Sacred flower
The Sacred Flower of Woodsfolk's Green Clan. They would honor the one who brings it back.

=== QUESTITEM DriadIdol01
White flower
A healing plant capable of curing many diseases.

=== QUESTITEM DriadLeaf00
Green leaf
The one who has a green leaf can switch off a magic trap.

=== QUESTITEM DumbLever
Dam lever
Use this lever to control the Orc dam.

=== QUESTITEM FakeDocument00
Useless papers
These are no good at all!

=== QUESTITEM GirlSign
Airy's jug
The jug Airy used to take with her.

=== QUESTITEM GoblinFright00
Goblins' sacred object
The head of the First Goblin worshipped by the tribe. The Goblin leader would pay dearly to have it back.

=== QUESTITEM GoldNugget00
Nugget
A golden nugget left behind by the workers during their escape from the pits.

=== QUESTITEM GoldNugget01
Emperor's seal
Any Khadagan man absolutely must give this seal to the Emperor's guard under penalty of horrible death.

=== QUESTITEM GolemCenterKey00
Key for altar
Use it to switch off the mechanical killers - the Golems.

=== QUESTITEM GovenorChest00
Box with collection
Part of the collection of rare weapons stolen from governor Valrasian.

=== QUESTITEM HadoganCageKey00
Death Canyon gates key
The key which opens the gates to Death Canyon.

=== QUESTITEM HadoganCaveKey00
Cave entrance key
Use this to open the gates to the cave.

=== QUESTITEM HeroCageKey00
Cage key
The key to the cage which holds Zak.

=== QUESTITEM Instruction4orcs00
Note in Orc language
You will need the Orc alphabet to translate it.

=== QUESTITEM Journal00
Notes
They will prove useful later on!

=== QUESTITEM Knife
Chisel
The steel chisel is one of the tools stolen from Master Babur.

=== QUESTITEM LeftCrystal
Crystal
The Witch uses such crystals for her spells.

=== QUESTITEM Letter2orcs00
Letter to Orcs
This will serve as proof that the murder of the Chosen is indeed planned.

=== QUESTITEM LizardClaw00
Claw
Use it to switch off the trap near the bridge leading to the hermit Lizard's lair.

=== QUESTITEM ManorKey00
Key to mansion
The key to a rich mansion.

=== QUESTITEM Map00
Redhead's map
The map taken from the brigand called "Redhead".

=== QUESTITEM MineControlKey00
Traps key
The key to the magic traps of the Portal defense.

=== QUESTITEM MineKey00
Gate key
The gates block the way to the abandoned pits. They cannot be opened without the key.

=== QUESTITEM MineKey01
Mine key
You must use this key to reach the mines.

=== QUESTITEM NecroLabKey00
Key to Necromancers' laboratory
The key which opens the laboratory where the scientist's body is kept.

=== QUESTITEM NewGear00
Island Orcs' mechanism
Use it to lower the drawbridges to the Orc islands in the river delta.

=== QUESTITEM Note
Letter to collector
This letter must be tossed to the Joon antique collector's house.

=== QUESTITEM Ogrekey1
Key to ogre Gym's coffer
This key will help you to open Gym's coffer.

=== QUESTITEM Ogrekey2
Key to ogre Utundry's coffer
This key will help you to open Utundry's coffer.

=== QUESTITEM Ogrestuff
ogre's necklace
Probably the ogre has discovered the loss of his necklace by now...will he figure out how he lost it?

=== QUESTITEM OldGear00
Old mechanism
A detail of drawbridge.

=== QUESTITEM OrcAlphabet
Orc ABC-book
Without it you will not be able to translate the Orcs' records which they made using their own letters.

=== QUESTITEM OrcAnnals00
Orcs' records
There may be a lot of interesting things in these. You should show them to Witch Estera.

=== QUESTITEM OrcLicense00
Hide with letters
The Orc "document" which tells about the Blue Stone. Try showing it to the Chief.

=== QUESTITEM Palantir
Magic orb
A mysterious magic orb which the Orcs worshipped.

=== QUESTITEM PalantirBroken00
Magic orb
An ancient magical artifact.

=== QUESTITEM PalantirRick00
Magic orb
An ancient magical artifact.

=== QUESTITEM PalantirWork00
Magic orb
An ancient magical artifact.

=== QUESTITEM RangerSign00
Spy's badge
This will serve as proof that the spy has been avenged.

=== QUESTITEM RightCrystal
Crystal
The Witch uses crystals like this for her spells.

=== QUESTITEM SackofGold
Sack of gold
Just what it looks like: a big, heavy sack full of gold.

=== QUESTITEM SquirrelSkin
Skins
Skins are good merchandise, but people in the city will not pay a decent price for them!

=== QUESTITEM TeleportKey00
Portal key
Use this to activate the Portal.

=== QUESTITEM ThiefSack
Collector's things
Part of the collection stolen from the house of the Joon rarities collector.

=== QUESTITEM Toy
Amulet
This amulet is a very important find!

=== QUESTITEM Vial00
Vial
A strange vial.

=== QUESTITEM VoodooWand
[Must be, but need no translation]
[Must be, but needs no translation]

=== QUESTITEM White_Wolf_Hide
White wolf's head
A trophy gained after a dangerous hunt; it will also prove that the leader of the wolfpack is really dead.

=== QUESTITEM Wolfskin
Wolf skin
A good trophy!

